const title = "Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 1 Walkthrough: Cell Phone Store";
const description = "Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 1 walkthrough for the Cell Phone Store: the SIM card in the handbag, the phone lock trace, the passcode 792438, the wall keypad and the finish worth +50 coins.";
const faqJsonLd = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the passcode in Rooms & Exits Chapter 2 Level 1?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "792438. There is only one number in the Cell Phone Store and you do not find it written on a wall: the handset in the shop prints it after you unlock it. Put the SIM card into the phone, draw the trace on the 3x3 lock screen, and a white pop-up reads \"Your passcode is: 792438\". That same code goes into the keypad on the wall unit."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the pattern to unlock the phone?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Start on the top-left dot and run along the top row: 1, 2, 3, 5 (top-left, top-middle, top-right, centre) is the part we could confirm twice from the recording. After the centre the line turns down to the bottom row; the last dots were not verifiable twice, so copy the trace from the Pattern item in the inventory (Examine), which is the exact trace the phone accepts."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Where do I get the SIM card?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "From the white handbag sitting on the sofa in the lounge. Tap the bag and the game hands you the item with the label \"SIM card\". Without it the phone only ever says \"No SIM Card Installed\" and the lock screen never appears."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What does the keypad code open?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The keypad is mounted on the wall unit near the reception desk. Entering 792438 releases the unit and exposes a metal panel with fifteen round buttons in three rows of five. Clearing that panel opens the inner compartment, which holds the key to the front door."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I finish the Cell Phone Store?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Take the key out of the open safe, open the inventory, select the key and press Use, then tap the green double door on the far left wall. An exit icon appears on the door, the camera pulls back and the level ends on the results screen with +50 coins."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long does the Cell Phone Store take?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The recording finishes it in 3:38 of level time, which is roughly three and a half minutes of play. Nothing in the level is timed and there is no fail state, so the only thing that can slow you down is hunting for the passcode before you have put the SIM card in the phone."}}]};
